{
  "api": "open_meteo",
  "base_url": "https://api.open-meteo.com/v1",
  "source": {
    "kind": "manual",
    "url": "https://open-meteo.com/en/docs",
    "retrieved": "2026-11-24",
    "note": "Written by hand from https://open-meteo.com/en/docs, the forecast page in sources.toml (cached 2026-11-24). One operation, GET /forecast, with every parameter in the page's parameter table plus minutely_15, which the page documents in its 15-Minutely section. Weather variable names (temperature_2m, …) are values of hourly, daily, current and minutely_15, not parameters. latitude and longitude are the only required parameters; the page says no required parameters will be added."
  },
